      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyasïwan kïgh anka tïkwïl ompö söpontönyan nyo le kwïle lö mi chi pö man nyo meghöy ompö mantanyi akïmi mwokïyon nyo letöy tagh kïsöpöy akwighöy ngokichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona melïkwï chi pö man kïtïl, amegh kegh nyo ngöghom kïtïl. Ompö ne temökenyi wure kegh? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amelïkwï mwokïyon kïsir anta ilïkwï sölwö, ompö ne temaka megha kïtomö osisweku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mïchini namanyi nyinö pö tagh, amepïstö nyinö pö odeny, ompöwölo choni cho teköy chi nyo wöghöy Tororöt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Töni ngöghomnyö owesyö chi nyo ngöghom kïtïl pöytoghï taman cho mi kanasyan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Möminye chi pö man ngwïny nyo ighöy nyo karam amegh ngokï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meyöpchï yit ngal löwïr cho mwoghöy pich, tömelïm mötworintengu ato chïpinyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ainkïtönyi ompö muyengu tïkwïl lö ichïpenyi pikö walaka kïnyïl cho chang.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyokïninian ngalechoni lapay ompö ngöghomnyö, olan, “Ongöghomitunan,” wölo kimarikanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Möminye chi nyo nkïtu ngal cho lowöch, cho kiröytö ori tya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyokyan kegh asyach atonkïtï ngöghomnyö nko kïgh nyo poru tïkwïn cho ighisyot, ghöyityö kï sölwontön akï chepoynön. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyorwan kïgh nyo ngwan kïtïl meghat, nyoni kï korka. Nöminyi chomnyenyi nyo koninyi nyinte le ngöghöp nyo karkegh ewunechi nko sïrïmtin, chi nyo wöghöy Tororöt nyo chïwïto nyinte, wölo nömöy nyinte chi pö ngokï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö omtoghintö arose lö kasïwan choni otini kotuyan kïgh akonga nko anka atonkïtwan chongïntöngwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyo mi söpontönyan kïyöröy kïnomnyö, akïtomönye asïwan. Konyorwan chi akonga nyo le mïrön ompö pich elpu akonga, wölo tomönye onyorwan korka ompö kwenu pïchoni löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyï kïgh nyo kanetan kegh kïpoto, lö kigh Tororöt chi kuten, wölo kïyar chane tïkwïn cho chang.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
